        {
          "no": 1,
          "en": "BUSINESS",
          "title": "业务对象与观测关系",
          "html": "<p>储罐雷达液位与视频刻度识别可以互相核对。演示将视频读数当作已完成识别的观测值，以已知噪声尺度融合，同时监视源间差值，区分精度改善和传感器失配报警。</p><figure class=\"figure\"><div style=\"overflow:auto\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 650 235\" role=\"img\" style=\"display:block;width:100%;min-width:560px;max-width:760px;margin:auto;font-family:system-ui,sans-serif\"><title>储罐液位与泄漏智能监控业务对象示意</title><path d=\"M45 120H605\" stroke=\"#21796a\" stroke-width=\"15\"/><rect x=\"75\" y=\"72\" width=\"95\" height=\"75\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#e7f0e7\" stroke=\"#667c75\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><circle cx=\"325\" cy=\"120\" r=\"28\" fill=\"white\" stroke=\"#667c75\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><path d=\"m311 104 30 16-30 16Z\" fill=\"#21796a\"/><rect x=\"495\" y=\"65\" width=\"95\" height=\"95\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#e7f0e7\" stroke=\"#667c75\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"70\" y=\"48\" font-size=\"17\">入口观测</text><text x=\"286\" y=\"48\" font-size=\"17\">泵与管段</text><text x=\"475\" y=\"48\" font-size=\"17\">出口与储罐</text><text x=\"180\" y=\"199\" font-size=\"17\">质量平衡 · 设备状态 · 测量可信度</text></svg></div><figcaption class=\"figcap\">储罐液位与泄漏智能监控涉及的业务对象示意；图中关系不是现场工艺设计。窄屏可在图内滚动。</figcaption></figure>"
        },
        {
          "no": 2,
          "en": "METHOD",
          "title": "液位多源方差加权融合",
          "html": "<p>生成100点液位真值，雷达噪声尺度0.08 m、第50点后漂移；视频噪声由控件指定。按逆方差权重融合，比较两单源与融合MAE，源间差超阈值进入复核。</p><figure class=\"figure\"><div style=\"overflow:auto\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 800 360\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"液位多源方差加权融合默认合成计算图\" style=\"display:block;width:100%;min-width:620px;max-width:850px;margin:auto;font-family:system-ui,sans-serif\"><title>液位多源方差加权融合默认合成计算图</title><text x=\"82\" y=\"27\" font-size=\"16\" fill=\"#355a4b\">液位 / m</text><path d=\"M82 274H720\" stroke=\"#dbe5dc\"/><text x=\"71\" y=\"279\" font-size=\"15\" text-anchor=\"end\" fill=\"#476457\">5.2</text><text x=\"82\" y=\"302\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"15\" fill=\"#476457\">0.0</text><path d=\"M82 220.5H720\" stroke=\"#dbe5dc\"/><text x=\"71\" y=\"225.5\" font-size=\"15\" text-anchor=\"end\" fill=\"#476457\">5.6</text><text x=\"241.5\" y=\"302\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"15\" fill=\"#476457\">24.8</text><path d=\"M82 167H720\" stroke=\"#dbe5dc\"/><text x=\"71\" y=\"172\" font-size=\"15\" text-anchor=\"end\" fill=\"#476457\">6.1</text><text x=\"401\" y=\"302\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"15\" fill=\"#476457\">49.5</text><path d=\"M82 113.5H720\" stroke=\"#dbe5dc\"/><text x=\"71\" y=\"118.5\" font-size=\"15\" text-anchor=\"end\" fill=\"#476457\">6.5</text><text x=\"560.5\" y=\"302\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"15\" fill=\"#476457\">74.3</text><path d=\"M82 60H720\" stroke=\"#dbe5dc\"/><text x=\"71\" y=\"65\" font-size=\"15\" text-anchor=\"end\" fill=\"#476457\">6.9</text><text x=\"720\" y=\"302\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"15\" fill=\"#476457\">99.0</text><path d=\"M82.00 174.15 L88.44 169.90 L94.89 165.65 L101.33 161.43 L107.78 157.24 L114.22 153.10 L120.67 149.00 L127.11 144.97 L133.56 141.01 L140.00 137.14 L146.44 133.35 L152.89 129.67 L159.33 126.10 L165.78 122.65 L172.22 119.33 L178.67 116.14 L185.11 113.10 L191.56 110.22 L198.00 107.49 L204.44 104.93 L210.89 102.54 L217.33 100.33 L223.78 98.31 L230.22 96.48 L236.67 94.